@NutritionService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5106
@token = REPLACE_WITH_JWT

### 6.1 Get personalized meal recommendations
GET {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/nutrition/recommendations?mealType=Lunch&page=1&pageSize=20&maxCalories=700&minProtein=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6.2 Get meal recommendations by userId
GET {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/nutrition/recommendations/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6.3 Get meal detail
GET {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/nutrition/meals/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6.4 Browse meal plans
GET {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/nutrition/meal-plans?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6.5 Get meal plans by calorie range
GET {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/nutrition/meal-plans/by-calories?calories=2200
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
